{{> layout/header}}

<section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER COMMUNITY</span>
        <h1>개발자의 생각을<br>기록하고 공유하세요.</h1>
        <p>개발 경험과 공부 기록을 나누는 개발자 커뮤니티입니다.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container board-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</span>
            <h2>최근 게시글</h2>
            <p>다양한 개발 이야기와 지식을 확인해 보세요.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="board-list">
        {{#boardList}}
            <article class="board-card">
                <div class="board-card-top">
                    <span class="category-label">DEVELOPMENT</span>
                    <span class="board-date">{{time}}</span>
                </div>
                <h3>{{title}}</h3>
                <div class="board-card-bottom">
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i> {{user.username}}</span>
                    <a href="/board/{{id}}" class="text-link">
                        상세보기 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </article>
        {{/boardList}}

        {{^boardList}}
            <div class="empty-state">
                <i class="fa-regular fa-folder-open"></i>
                <h3>아직 게시글이 없습니다.</h3>
                <p>첫 번째 게시글이 등록되면 이곳에 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
        {{/boardList}}
    </div>

    <ul class="pagination d-flex justify-content-center mt-5">
        <li class="page-item disabled"><a class="page-link" href="#">Previous</a></li>
        <li class="page-item active"><a class="page-link" href="#">1</a></li>
        <li class="page-item"><a class="page-link" href="#">2</a></li>
        <li class="page-item"><a class="page-link" href="#">Next</a></li>
    </ul>
</section>

{{> layout/footer}}